mbbR7hORRFwQ7kNvwF_4EPd&_nc_oc=AdrXLp4Ns1Q7U5b8NGSUXu4B7fSuVT7eQDtlFWE-KSc_-BATJYajsmQNlmbP3ymadmg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMN8M_4hO7Sr-d6Q0Iec2rooCVoPq_U6NuQvx2IW9wF-A&oe=6AD3BAF7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QsaPoYrb_L8Q7kNvwH2BZaB&_nc_oc=AdrC1ChO05_dmx6HCHGZjiEjrgu655Mjk8HMphF0goN32i2t7eS4D7x_UeFN3a-qCFU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPygWLESkc9jj0OwyRUDKbceo5nw_MOxczoLMFpL4PpXg&oe=6AD3BC8A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ra7UGBZjRbUQ7kNvwFaG9Y1&_nc_oc=Adol2kpAz-7xBoL497lJ1uCDJhowSeAk_LFHFDi5as0poQlcp2XZjyvza8Evgy2LoJs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPNzQ0wIk5QEifEchf5km_UUB2MfmoGczYKUv7Hh2uwzw&oe=6AD3A9AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DLeiDWK2xG4Q7kNvwHRCcxA&_nc_oc=Adpnvy8JfeZZaGrNBVQe__YCLVvueD3XNLJpHC9KaaiUg7hsSAwMFCP_-Akmpwhc9uw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMXXrpBMyjlyzEp7WB4yMNhDI1yi46sqjvNwYjRm2gbXQ&oe=6AD39303"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CN1exmsr6nMQ7kNvwG1cMKR&_nc_oc=AdqUmFRCOVtaq8eZCXYRxP6oEJGU64iVduWSX5JgkHSsoVtZ3XsasJNntfdmR5DndAY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPhXd5XawaOzhVb4QlStF8LyogL_5UoNtYlq-PF_0sInQ&oe=6AD38B58"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iRbwSYdyMIEQ7kNvwFebC8P&_nc_oc=AdqzSDiYDTGpiATLQ7tsFmgjasDs6InlFfE1zpnZv1Vnr0E0XIUnwHQWIOWi9mvX-t4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMqRnZyAl9mCivtvW9WwWkY3lQmI3Z4IGPwvETMl1rvlA&oe=6AD39E7C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080